Stop Colima to free up resources.

The state of the VM is persisted at stop. A start afterwards
should return it back to its previous state.

Usage:
  colima stop [profile] [flags]

Flags:
  -f, --force   stop without graceful shutdown
  -h, --help    help for stop

Global Flags:
  -p, --profile string   profile name, for multiple instances (default "default")
  -v, --verbose          enable verbose log
      --very-verbose     enable more verbose log
